        <span>· <b>2.4M+</b> Downloads</span>
        <span>· <span class="stars">★★★★★</span> <b>4.8</b> App Store</span>
        <span>· <b>USA · Canada · Mexico</b> · 16 Host Cities</span>
      </div>
    </div>

